{"block_id": "ch07-b0001", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "c4ec1aad737602b5", "translated": "虽然单体智能体架构在解决定义明确的问题时可能行之有效,但当面对跨多个领域的复杂任务时,其能力往往受到限制。多智能体协作(Multi-Agent Collaboration)模式通过将系统构建为由若干独立、专精的智能体组成的协作整体,来应对这些局限。该方法建立在任务分解的原则之上:将高层目标拆分为离散的子问题,再将每个子问题分配给具备最契合该任务所需工具、数据访问或推理能力的智能体。\n\n例如,一个复杂的研究查询可被分解后分配给负责信息检索的研究智能体(Research Agent)、负责统计处理的数据分析智能体(Data Analysis Agent),以及负责生成最终报告的综合智能体(Synthesis Agent)。此类系统的效能不仅源于劳动分工,更关键地依赖于智能体间通信的机制。这要求采用标准化的通信协议与共享的本体(Ontology),使智能体能够交换数据、委派子任务并协调其行动,从而确保最终输出的连贯性。\n\n这种分布式架构带来了若干优势,包括更高的模块化、可扩展性与鲁棒性:单个智能体的失效不一定会导致整个系统崩溃。协作能够产生协同效应,使多智能体系统的整体性能超越其中任何单一智能体所能达到的能力上限。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:02:51.915801", "block_id": "ch07-b0001", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 643, "output_tokens": 252, "elapsed_sec": 4.23, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0002", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "8c13c146d8a774ce", "translated": "Crew AI 和 Google ADK 等框架旨在通过提供用于定义智能体、任务及其交互流程的结构来促进这一范式。该方法对于需要多种专门知识、包含多个离散阶段,或利用并发处理优势以及跨智能体信息相互印证等场景尤为有效。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:02:53.217523", "block_id": "ch07-b0002", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 456, "output_tokens": 57, "elapsed_sec": 1.3, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0003", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "24783fd32fe8490d", "translated": "## 实际应用与使用场景\n\n多智能体协作是一种强大的模式,适用于众多领域:\n\n- **复杂研究与分析**:一组智能体可以协作完成一个研究项目。一个智能体可以专门负责检索学术数据库,另一个负责总结研究发现,第三个负责识别趋势,第四个负责将信息综合成报告。这反映了人类研究团队的工作方式。\n- **软件开发**:想象一下智能体协作构建软件。一个智能体可以作为需求分析师,另一个作为代码生成器,第三个作为测试人员,第四个作为文档编写者。它们可以相互传递输出,以构建和验证各个组件。\n- **创意内容生成**:创建一个营销活动可能涉及市场研究智能体、文案撰写智能体、平面设计智能体(使用图像生成工具)和社交媒体调度智能体,它们协同工作。\n- **金融分析**:多智能体系统可以分析金融市场。智能体可以专门负责获取股票数据、分析新闻情绪、执行技术分析,并生成投资建议。\n- **客户支持升级**:一线支持智能体可以处理初步咨询,在需要时将复杂问题升级给专家智能体(例如,技术专家或账单专员),展示了基于问题复杂度的顺序交接。\n- **供应链优化**:智能体可以代表供应链中的不同节点(供应商、制造商、分销商),并协作优化库存水平、物流和调度,以应对变化的需求或中断。\n- **网络分析与修复**:智能体架构为自主运营带来巨大优势,特别是在故障定位方面。多个智能体可以协作对问题进行分类和修复,建议最优操作。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:02:56.460439", "block_id": "ch07-b0003", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4724, "output_tokens": 308, "elapsed_sec": 3.24, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0004", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "192cc1d8f407aa53", "translated": "这些智能体还可以与传统的机器学习模型和工具集成,既能利用现有系统,又能同时发挥生成式 AI 的优势。通过清晰地划分专门的智能体并细致地编排它们之间的相互关系,开发者能够构建出具备更强模块化能力、可扩展性,以及能够应对单一整体智能体无法胜任的复杂任务的系统。\n\n<!-- TRANSLATION_NOTE: 下一块标题\"Multi-Agent Collaboration: Exploring Interrelationships and Communication Structures\"按术语表规则译为\"多智能体协作:探索相互关系与通信结构\" -->", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:02:58.995071", "block_id": "ch07-b0004", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4422, "output_tokens": 112, "elapsed_sec": 2.53, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0005", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "c645b4016e91da35", "translated": "## 多智能体协作(Multi-Agent Collaboration):探索智能体间关系与通信结构\n\n理解智能体之间交互与通信的复杂方式,是设计高效多智能体系统的关键基础。如图 7.2 所示,智能体间关系与通信模型存在一个谱系,范围从最简单的单智能体场景,到复杂的、定制设计的协作框架。每种模型都有其独特的优势与挑战,并影响多智能体系统的整体效率、鲁棒性与适应性。\n\n![图 7.2 智能体的多种通信与交互方式](svg/fig-7-2.svg)\n\n*图 7.2 智能体以多种方式进行通信与交互*", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:01.887815", "block_id": "ch07-b0005", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4593, "output_tokens": 138, "elapsed_sec": 2.89, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0006", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "1e5000adeb14fa4d", "translated": "1. **Single Agent**:在最基础的层面,\"单个智能体(Single Agent)\"自主运行,不与其他实体进行直接交互或通信。虽然这种模型实现和管理都很简单,但其能力本质上受限于单个智能体的范围和资源。它适用于可以分解为独立子问题的任务,每个子问题可由一个自给自足的智能体解决。\n2. **Network**:\"网络(Network)\"模型代表了迈向协作的重要一步,其中多个智能体以去中心化的方式直接相互交互。通信通常以点对点的方式进行,从而允许共享信息、资源,甚至任务。该模型有助于增强韧性,因为一个智能体的失效不一定会瘫痪整个系统。然而,在大型非结构化网络中,管理通信开销并确保决策一致性可能具有挑战性。\n3. **Supervisor**:在\"监督器(Supervisor)\"模型中,一个专门的智能体,即\"监督器\",负责监督和协调一组从属智能体的活动。监督器充当通信、任务分配和冲突解决的核心枢纽。这种层次结构提供了清晰的权限链条,可以简化管理和控制。然而,它引入了单点故障(即监督器),并且如果监督器被大量从属智能体或复杂任务压垮,它可能成为瓶颈。\n4. **Supervisor as a Tool**:该模型是对\"监督器\"概念的细致延伸,其中监督器的角色较少涉及直接的命令与控制,而更多在于为其他智能体提供资源、指导或分析支持。监督器可以提供工具、数据或计算服务,使其他智能体能够更有效地执行其任务,而不必强制规定其每一个具体动作。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:06.929566", "block_id": "ch07-b0006", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4758, "output_tokens": 315, "elapsed_sec": 5.04, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0007", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "de74fea816088f4c", "translated": "5. 分层(Hierarchical):\"分层\"模型在监督器概念的基础上扩展,构建多层组织结构。它涉及多级监督器,高级监督器负责监督低级监督器,最终在最底层汇聚一组操作智能体。该结构非常适合可分解为子问题的复杂问题,每个子问题由层次结构中的特定层级管理。它为可扩展性和复杂性管理提供了一种结构化方法,允许在既定边界内进行分布式决策。\n\n6. 自定义(Custom):\"自定义\"模型代表了多智能体系统设计的终极灵活性。它允许创建独特的相互关系和通信结构,精准契合特定问题或应用的具体需求。这可能涉及结合前述模型元素的混合方法,或源自环境独特约束和机遇的全新型设计方案。自定义模型通常源于对特定性能指标的优化需求、处理高度动态环境的需要,或将领域特定知识纳入系统架构的考量。设计和实现自定义模型通常需要深入理解多智能体系统原则,并仔细考虑通信协议、协调机制和涌现行为。\n\n总之,为多智能体系统选择相互关系和通信模型是一项关键的设计决策。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:09.242329", "block_id": "ch07-b0007", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 709, "output_tokens": 275, "elapsed_sec": 2.31, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.20639}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0008", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "4f5662c04d618f53", "translated": "每种模型都有其独特的优点和缺点,最优选择取决于任务复杂度、智能体数量、期望的自主程度、鲁棒性需求以及可接受的通信开销等多方面因素。随着多智能体系统(Multi-Agent Systems)的持续演进,未来有望进一步探索并优化这些模型,同时开发出新的协作智能范式。\n\n## 实战代码 (Crew AI)\n\n下面这段 Python 代码使用 CrewAI 框架定义了一个由 AI 驱动的协作团队,用于生成一篇关于 AI 趋势的博客文章。代码首先配置运行环境,从 `.env` 文件中加载 API 密钥。应用的核心在于定义两个智能体(Agent):一个负责搜集并总结 AI 趋势的研究员(Researcher),以及一个基于研究成果撰写博客文章的写作者(Writer)。相应地,定义了两项任务(Task):一项用于调研 AI 趋势,另一项用于撰写博客文章,其中撰写任务依赖于调研任务的输出。这些智能体和任务随后被组装成一个 Crew(CrewAI 中的执行单元),并指定为顺序执行流程,即任务按顺序依次执行。Crew 在初始化时接收这些智能体、任务以及一个语言模型(具体使用的是 \"gemini-2.0-flash\" 模型)。主函数通过调用 `kickoff()` 方法启动该 Crew,编排各个智能体之间的协作以生成预期的输出。最后,代码打印 Crew 执行后的最终结果,即生成的博客文章。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:12.176214", "block_id": "ch07-b0008", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4671, "output_tokens": 343, "elapsed_sec": 2.93, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206416}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0009", "type": "code", "source_sha256": "34d4c56887d943cf", "translated": "import os\n  from dotenv import load_dotenv\n  from crewai import Agent, Task, Crew, Process\n  from langchain_google_genai import ChatGoogleGenerativeAI\n  def setup_environment():\n     \"\"\"Loads environment variables and checks for the required\n  API key.\"\"\"\n     load_dotenv()\n     if not os.getenv(\"GOOGLE_API_KEY\"):\n         raise ValueError(\"GOOGLE_API_KEY not found. Please set it\n  in your .env file.\")\n  def main():\n     \"\"\"\n     Initializes and runs the AI crew for content creation using\n  the latest Gemini model.\n     \"\"\"\n     setup_environment()\n     # Define the language model to use.\n     # Updated to a model from the Gemini 2.0 series for better\n  performance and features.\n     # For cutting-edge (preview) capabilities, you could use\n  \"gemini-2.5-flash\".\n     llm = ChatGoogleGenerativeAI(model=\"gemini-2.0-flash\")\n     # Define Agents with specific roles and goals\n     researcher = Agent(\n         role='Senior Research Analyst',\n         goal='Find and summarize the latest trends in AI.',\n         backstory=\"You are an experienced research analyst with a\n  knack     for   identifying   key    trends   and    synthesizing\n  information.\",\n         verbose=True,\n         allow_delegation=False,\n     )\n     writer = Agent(\n         role='Technical Content Writer',\n         goal='Write a clear and engaging blog post based on\n  research findings.',\n         backstory=\"You are a skilled writer who can translate\n  complex technical topics into accessible content.\",\n         verbose=True,\n         allow_delegation=False,\n     )\n     # Define Tasks for the agents\n     research_task = Task(\n         description=\"Research the top 3 emerging trends in\n  Artificial Intelligence in 2024-2025. Focus on practical appli-\n  cations and potential impact.\",\n         expected_output=\"A detailed summary of the top 3 AI\n  trends, including key points and sources.\",\n         agent=researcher,\n     )\n     writing_task = Task(\n         description=\"Write a 500-word blog post based on the\n  research findings. The post should be engaging and easy for a\n  general audience to understand.\",\n         expected_output=\"A complete 500-word blog post about the\n  latest AI trends.\",\n         agent=writer,\n         context=[research_task],\n     )\n     # Create the Crew\n     blog_creation_crew = Crew(\n         agents=[researcher, writer],\n         tasks=[research_task, writing_task],\n         process=Process.sequential,\n         llm=llm,\n         verbose=2 # Set verbosity for detailed crew execution logs\n     )\n     # Execute the Crew\n     print(\"## Running the blog creation crew with Gemini 2.0\n  Flash... ##\")\n     try:\n         result = blog_creation_crew.kickoff()\n         print(\"\\n------------------\\n\")\n         print(\"## Crew Final Output ##\")\n         print(result)\n     except Exception as e:\n         print(f\"\\nAn unexpected error occurred: {e}\")\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n     main()", "translate": false, "status": "passthrough"}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0010", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "c13b222420a8ea74", "translated": "接下来我们将深入探讨 Google ADK 框架中的更多示例,重点关注分层、并行和顺序协调范式,以及将智能体作为操作工具的实现。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:13.555666", "block_id": "ch07-b0010", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4437, "output_tokens": 34, "elapsed_sec": 1.38, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0011", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "fed11b9f32789ce1", "translated": "### 实践代码(Google ADK)\n\n以下代码示例演示了如何通过创建父子关系,在 Google ADK 中建立一个分层(层次结构)的智能体结构。代码定义了两类智能体:LlmAgent 和一个从 BaseAgent 派生的自定义 TaskExecutor 智能体。TaskExecutor 专为特定的、非 LLM 的任务而设计,在本例中,它仅产生一个 \"Task finished successfully\" 事件。一个名为 greeter 的 LlmAgent 被初始化,指定了模型,并被指示充当一个友好的问候者。自定义 TaskExecutor 被实例化为 task_doer。创建了一个名为 coordinator 的父级 LlmAgent,同样带有模型和指令。coordinator 的指令引导它将问候任务委派给 greeter,将任务执行委派给 task_doer。greeter 和 task_doer 作为子智能体被添加到 coordinator,从而建立了父子关系。然后代码断言该关系已正确建立。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:15.990550", "block_id": "ch07-b0011", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4574, "output_tokens": 186, "elapsed_sec": 2.43, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0012", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "5cbcecead064872e", "translated": "```python\nfrom google.adk.agents import LlmAgent, BaseAgent\nfrom         google.adk.agents.invocation_context        import\nInvocationContext\nfrom google.adk.events import Event\nfrom typing import AsyncGenerator\n# Correctly implement a custom agent by extending BaseAgent\nclass TaskExecutor(BaseAgent):\n    \"\"\"A specialized agent with custom, non-LLM behavior.\"\"\"\n    name: str = \"TaskExecutor\"\n    description: str = \"Executes a predefined task.\"\n    async def _run_async_impl(self, context: InvocationContext)\n-> AsyncGenerator[Event, None]:\n        \"\"\"Custom implementation logic for the task.\"\"\"\n        # This is where your custom logic would go.\n        # For this example, we'll just yield a simple event.\n        yield   Event(author=self.name,  content=\"Task   finished\nsuccessfully.\")\n# Define individual agents with proper initialization\n# LlmAgent requires a model to be specified.\ngreeter = LlmAgent(\n    name=\"Greeter\",\n    model=\"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\",\n    instruction=\"You are a friendly greeter.\"\n)\ntask_doer = TaskExecutor() # Instantiate our concrete cus-\ntom agent\n# Create a parent agent and assign its sub-agents\n# The parent agent's description and instructions should guide\nits delegation logic.\ncoordinator = LlmAgent(\n    name=\"Coordinator\",\n    model=\"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\",\n    description=\"A coordinator that can greet users and execute\ntasks.\",\n    instruction=\"When asked to greet, delegate to the Greeter. When asked to perform a task, delegate to the TaskExecutor.\",\n    sub_agents=[\n        greeter,\n        task_doer\n    ]\n)\n# The ADK framework automatically establishes the parent-child\nrelationships.\n# These assertions will pass if checked after initialization.\nassert greeter.parent_agent == coordinator\nassert task_doer.parent_agent == coordinator\nprint(\"Agent hierarchy created successfully.\")\n```\n\n最后,它会打印一条消息,表明智能体层级已成功创建。\n\n<!-- TRANSLATION_NOTE: 代码块内原文存在明显 PDF 换行断字(如 \"Invo-\\ncationContext\"、\"cus-\\ntom agent\" 等),已按实际语义合并为单行以保证可执行;如需逐字还原断行形态,可改回原排版。 -->", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:19.435985", "block_id": "ch07-b0012", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4881, "output_tokens": 405, "elapsed_sec": 3.44, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206514}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0013", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "3a98627e65a27b76", "translated": "此代码片段展示了在 Google ADK 框架内使用 LoopAgent 来建立迭代工作流。代码定义了两个智能体(Agent):ConditionChecker 和 ProcessingStep。ConditionChecker 是一个自定义智能体,用于检查会话状态中的 \"status\" 值。如果 \"status\" 为 \"completed\",ConditionChecker 会触发一个事件以终止循环;否则,它会生成一个事件以继续循环。ProcessingStep 是一个使用 \"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\" 模型的 LlmAgent。其指令是执行一项任务,并在最终步骤将会话 \"status\" 设置为 \"completed\"。创建了一个名为 StatusPoller 的 LoopAgent。StatusPoller 配置了 max_iterations = 10。StatusPoller 包含 ProcessingStep 以及一个 ConditionChecker 实例作为子智能体。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:21.354161", "block_id": "ch07-b0013", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4530, "output_tokens": 158, "elapsed_sec": 1.91, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0014", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "68808bd83f9e3997", "translated": "LoopAgent 将按顺序执行子智能体,最多执行 10 次迭代,若 ConditionChecker 发现状态为 \"completed\",则停止循环。\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\nfrom typing import AsyncGenerator\nfrom google.adk.agents import LoopAgent, LlmAgent, BaseAgent\nfrom google.adk.events import Event, EventActions\nfrom google.adk.agents.invocation_context import InvocationContext\n\n# Best Practice: Define custom agents as complete, self-describing classes.\nclass ConditionChecker(BaseAgent):\n    \"\"\"A custom agent that checks for a 'completed' status in the session state.\"\"\"\n    name: str = \"ConditionChecker\"\n    description: str = \"Checks if a process is complete and signals the loop to stop.\"\n\n    async def _run_async_impl(\n        self, context: InvocationContext\n    ) -> AsyncGenerator[Event, None]:\n        \"\"\"Checks state and yields an event to either continue or stop the loop.\"\"\"\n        status = context.session.state.get(\"status\", \"pending\")\n        is_done = (status == \"completed\")\n        if is_done:\n            # Escalate to terminate the loop when the condition is met.\n            yield Event(author=self.name, actions=EventActions(escalate=True))\n        else:\n            # Yield a simple event to continue the loop.\n            yield Event(author=self.name, content=\"Condition not met, continuing loop.\")\n\n# Correction: The LlmAgent must have a model and clear instructions.\nprocess_step = LlmAgent(\n    name=\"ProcessingStep\",\n    model=\"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\",\n    instruction=\"You are a step in a longer process. Perform your task.\n```", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:23.975135", "block_id": "ch07-b0014", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4822, "output_tokens": 339, "elapsed_sec": 2.62, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206563}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0015", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "36869b11243350b1", "translated": "```python\n# If you are the final step, update session state by setting\n# 'status' to 'completed'.\n# The LoopAgent orchestrates the workflow.\npoller = LoopAgent(\n    name=\"StatusPoller\",\n    max_iterations=10,\n    sub_agents=[\n        process_step,\n        ConditionChecker() # Instantiating the well-defined cus-\ntom agent.\n    ]\n)\n# This poller will now execute 'process_step'\n# and then 'ConditionChecker'\n# repeatedly until the status is 'completed' or 10 iterations\n# have passed.\n```\n\n此代码片段阐明了 Google ADK 中的顺序智能体(SequentialAgent)模式,专为构建线性工作流而设计。该代码使用 `google.adk.agents` 库定义了一个顺序智能体流水线。该流水线由两个智能体组成:`step1` 和 `step2`。`step1` 名为 \"Step1_Fetch\",其输出将存储在会话状态中的 \"data\" 键下。`step2` 名为 \"Step2_Process\",被指示分析存储在 `session.state[\"data\"]` 中的信息并提供摘要。名为 \"MyPipeline\" 的顺序智能体(SequentialAgent)编排这些子智能体的执行。当使用初始输入运行该流水线时,`step1` 将首先执行。`step1` 的响应将保存到会话状态中的 \"data\" 键下。随后,`step2` 将执行,按照其指令利用 `step1` 放入状态中的信息。此结构允许构建工作流,其中一个个智能体的输出成为下个智能体的输入。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:27.130820", "block_id": "ch07-b0015", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4726, "output_tokens": 334, "elapsed_sec": 3.15, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206607}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0016", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "311513613d73ce26", "translated": "This is a common pattern in creating multi-step AI or data processing pipelines.\n\n```python\nfrom google.adk.agents import SequentialAgent, Agent\n\n# This agent's output will be saved to session.state[\"data\"]\nstep1 = Agent(name=\"Step1_Fetch\", output_key=\"data\")\n\n# This agent will use the data from the previous step.\n# We instruct it on how to find and use this data.\nstep2 = Agent(\n    name=\"Step2_Process\",\n    instruction=\"Analyze the information found in state['data'] and provide a summary.\"\n)\n\npipeline = SequentialAgent(\n    name=\"MyPipeline\",\n    sub_agents=[step1, step2]\n)\n\n# When the pipeline is run with an initial input, Step1 will execute,\n# its response will be stored in session.state[\"data\"], and then\n# Step2 will execute, using the information from the state as instructed.\n```", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:47.381589", "block_id": "ch07-b0016", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 597, "output_tokens": 185, "elapsed_sec": 20.25, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206632}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0017", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "45c4311fb1e881b6", "translated": "以下代码示例演示了 Google ADK 中的并行化化智能体(ParallelAgent)模式,该模式支持多个智能体任务的并发执行。`data_gatherer` 被设计为并发运行两个子智能体:`weather_fetcher` 和 `news_fetcher`。`weather_fetcher` 智能体被指示获取指定地点的天气,并将结果存储在 `session.state[\"weather_data\"]` 中。类似地,`news_fetcher` 智能体被指示检索指定主题的头条新闻,并将其存储在 `session.state[\"news_data\"]` 中。每个子智能体均配置使用 \"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\" 模型。并行化化智能体(ParallelAgent)负责编排这些子智能体的执行,使它们能够并行化工作。`weather_fetcher` 和 `news_fetcher` 的结果将被收集并存储在会话状态中。最后,该示例展示了如何在智能体执行完成后,从 `final_state` 中访问所收集的天气和新闻数据。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:50.541363", "block_id": "ch07-b0017", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4592, "output_tokens": 202, "elapsed_sec": 3.16, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0018", "type": "code", "source_sha256": "8f448595d8d87a86", "translated": "from google.adk.agents import Agent, ParallelAgent\n  # It's better to define the fetching logic as tools for the agents\n  # For simplicity in this example, we'll embed the logic in the\n  agent's instruction.\n  # In a real-world scenario, you would use tools.\n  # Define the individual agents that will run in parallel\n  weather_fetcher = Agent(\n     name=\"weather_fetcher\",\n     model=\"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\",\n     instruction=\"Fetch the weather for the given location and\n  return only the weather report.\",\n     output_key=\"weather_data\"  # The result will be stored in\n  session.state[\"weather_data\"]\n  )\n  news_fetcher = Agent(\n     name=\"news_fetcher\",\n     model=\"gemini-2.0-flash-exp\",\n     instruction=\"Fetch the top news story for the given topic and\n  return only that story.\",\n     output_key=\"news_data\"      # The result will be stored in\n  session.state[\"news_data\"]\n  )\n  # Create the ParallelAgent to orchestrate the sub-agents\n  data_gatherer = ParallelAgent(\n     name=\"data_gatherer\",\n     sub_agents=[\n         weather_fetcher,\n         news_fetcher\n     ]\n  )", "translate": false, "status": "passthrough"}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0019", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "6738dac51933bfa3", "translated": "所提供的代码段在 Google ADK 中展示了\"智能体即工具\"(Agent as a Tool)范式,使一个智能体能够以类似于函数调用的方式利用另一个智能体的能力。具体而言,该代码使用 Google 的 LlmAgent 和 AgentTool 类定义了一个图像生成系统。它由两个智能体组成:父级 artist_agent 和子级 image_generator_agent。generate_image 函数是一个简单的工具,用于模拟图像创建并返回模拟图像数据。image_generator_agent 负责根据其接收到的文本提示使用此工具。artist_agent 的角色首先是创作一个富有创意的图像提示。然后,它通过 AgentTool 包装器调用 image_generator_agent。AgentTool 充当桥梁,允许一个智能体将另一个智能体用作工具。当 artist_agent 调用 image_tool 时,AgentTool 会使用 artist 发明的提示来调用 image_generator_agent。然后,image_generator_agent 使用该提示调用 generate_image 函数。最终,生成的图像(或模拟数据)通过这些智能体向上返回。此架构展示了一个分层智能体系统,其中高层级智能体编排低层级、专门化的智能体来执行任务。\n\n```python\nfrom google.adk.agents import LlmAgent\nfrom google.adk.tools import agent_tool\nfrom google.genai import types\n\n# 1. A simple function tool for the core capability.\n# This follows the best practice of separating actions from reasoning.\ndef generate_image(prompt: str) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Generates an image based on a textual prompt. Args:\n        prompt: A detailed description of the image to generate.\n```", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:54.778803", "block_id": "ch07-b0019", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 811, "output_tokens": 322, "elapsed_sec": 4.23, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206697}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0020", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "28fcc70b1e48c68a", "translated": "```python\n    Returns:\n        A dictionary with the status and the generated image bytes.\n    \"\"\"\n    print(f\"TOOL: Generating image for prompt: '{prompt}'\")\n    # In a real implementation, this would call an image generation API.\n    # For this example, we return mock image data.\n    mock_image_bytes = b\"mock_image_data_for_a_cat_wearing_a_hat\"\n    return {\n        \"status\": \"success\",\n        # The tool returns the raw bytes, the agent will handle the Part creation.\n        \"image_bytes\": mock_image_bytes,\n        \"mime_type\": \"image/png\"\n    }\n\n# 2. Refactor the ImageGeneratorAgent into an LlmAgent.\n# It now correctly uses the input passed to it.\nimage_generator_agent = LlmAgent(\n    name=\"ImageGen\",\n    model=\"gemini-2.0-flash\",\n    description=\"Generates an image based on a detailed text prompt.\",\n    instruction=(\n        \"You are an image generation specialist. Your task is to take the user's request \"\n        \"and use the `generate_image` tool to create the image. \"\n        \"The user's entire request should be used as the 'prompt' argument for the tool. \"\n        \"After the tool returns the image bytes, you MUST output the image.\"\n    ),\n    tools=[generate_image]\n)\n\n# 3. Wrap the corrected agent in an AgentTool.\n# The description here is what the parent agent sees.\nimage_tool = agent_tool.AgentTool(\n    agent=image_generator_agent,\n    description=\"Use this tool to generate an image. The input should be a descriptive prompt of the desired image.\"\n)\n\n# 4. The parent agent remains unchanged. Its logic was correct.\nartist_agent = LlmAgent(\n    name=\"Artist\",\n    model=\"gemini-2.0-flash\",\n    instruction=(\n        \"You are a creative artist. First, invent a creative and descriptive prompt for an image. \"\n        \"Then, use the `ImageGen` tool to generate the image using your prompt.\"\n    ),\n    tools=[image_tool]\n)\n```", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:03:58.975711", "block_id": "ch07-b0020", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4974, "output_tokens": 518, "elapsed_sec": 4.2, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206729}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0021", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "55214864cbc018b7", "translated": "## 概览\n\n**What(是什么)** 复杂问题往往超出单一、整体式基于大语言模型(LLM)的智能体能力范围。单个智能体可能缺乏完成多面任务各部分所需的多样化专业技能或特定工具访问能力。这一局限形成瓶颈,降低系统的整体有效性和可扩展性。因此,处理复杂的多领域目标变得低效,并可能导致不完整或次优的结果。\n\n**Why(为什么)** 多智能体协作(Multi-Agent Collaboration)模式通过创建一个由多个协作智能体组成的系统,提供了一种标准化的解决方案。复杂问题被分解为更小、更易处理的子问题。每个子问题随后被分配给具备解决该子问题所需的精确工具和能力的专门智能体。这些智能体通过明确定义的通信协议和交互模型进行协作,例如顺序交接、并行工作流或分层委派。这种智能体式、分布式的方法产生协同效应,使整个群体能够实现任何单个智能体都无法实现的成果。\n\n**Rule of Thumb(经验法则)** 当任务对单个智能体而言过于复杂,且可以分解为需要专门技能或工具的不同子任务时,使用此模式。它非常适合受益于多样化专业知识、并行化处理或具有多个阶段的结构化工作流的问题,例如复杂的研究和分析、软件开发或创意内容生成。\n\n<!-- TRANSLATION_NOTE: 原文中 \"What\"、\"Why\"、\"Rule of Thumb\" 为小节侧边栏式排版,译文以加粗中文标题呈现以保持语义清晰 -->", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:04:02.081665", "block_id": "ch07-b0021", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4668, "output_tokens": 304, "elapsed_sec": 3.1, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0022", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "c41a94c64228e01f", "translated": "![图 7.3 多智能体设计模式总览](svg/fig-7-3.svg)\n\n图 7.3 多智能体设计模式(Multi-Agent Design Pattern)\n\n## 要点总结\n\n- 多智能体协作(Multi-Agent Collaboration)涉及多个智能体协同工作以达成共同目标。\n- 该模式利用专业角色、任务分配与智能体间通信。\n- 协作可以采取顺序交接、并行化处理、辩论或层级结构等形式。\n- 该模式非常适合需要多元专业知识或多个不同阶段的复杂问题。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:04:04.363858", "block_id": "ch07-b0022", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 595, "output_tokens": 103, "elapsed_sec": 2.28, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0023", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "599ecfa72ca325a1", "translated": "## 结论\n\n本章探讨了多智能体协作模式，展示了在系统中编排多个专门化智能体所带来的益处。我们考察了多种协作模型，强调了该模式在跨领域解决复杂、多面性问题中的核心作用。理解智能体之间的协作，自然会引出对其与外部环境交互方式的探究。", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:04:06.379752", "block_id": "ch07-b0023", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 4431, "output_tokens": 64, "elapsed_sec": 2.01, "stop_reason": "end_turn"}}
{"block_id": "ch07-b0024", "type": "text", "source_sha256": "738f392440c12cab", "translated": "## 参考文献\n\n多智能体协作机制:大语言模型综述:https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.06322\n\n多智能体系统——协作的力量:https://aravindakumar.medium.com/introducing-multi-agent-frameworks-the-power-of-collaboration-e9db31bba1b6", "translate": true, "status": "translated", "usage": {"ts": "2026-08-09T10:04:07.936028", "block_id": "ch07-b0024", "chapter_id": 7, "model": "MiniMax-M3[1m]", "input_tokens": 439, "output_tokens": 86, "elapsed_sec": 1.55, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "retranslated_ts": 1786244645.206799}}
